{"id":"n53785-4-7","stage":2,"title":"떠오르다 · 引人瞩目","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53785-4-7-1","ko":"신인 배우가 해외에서 상을 받았다면서요?","zh":"听说有位新人演员在国外获得了奖项？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신인","meaning":"新人，新手","explanation":"신인：新人，新手。","readings":[{"term":"신인","audio":"/audio/9ba4194ae64dfc992ab2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14071","senseId":"1","lemma":"신인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신인","audio":"/audio/9ba4194ae64dfc992ab2.mp3"}},{"text":"배우가","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배우가","audio":"/audio/71eed0fd360842635c34.mp3"}},{"text":"해외에서","meaning":"海外，国外","explanation":"해외：海外，国外；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"해외","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62481","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해외에서","audio":"/audio/c04c19c082bbdb5cc008.mp3"}},{"text":"상을","meaning":"奖","explanation":"상：奖；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"상","audio":"/audio/3c2d6ddb4a94f1f36375.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62113","senseId":"2","lemma":"상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상을","audio":"/audio/8a9533d1c73ef1cf459c.mp3"}},{"text":"받았다면서요?","meaning":"取得，获得","explanation":"받다：取得，获得；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다면서요：引用所听到的陈述，再向对方确认：“听说……，是吗？”。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"4","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받았다면서요","audio":"/audio/48ef2fa8c9be8ca26674.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ba4194ae64dfc99","term":"신인","zh":"新人，新手","audio":"/audio/9ba4194ae64dfc992ab2.mp3","entryId":"14071","definition":"在某个领域新登场开始活动的人。","pronunciation":["시닌"]},{"id